    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17151" root="رون" body-key="r">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَانَ</span></b> , [aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَرُونُ</span>,] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَوْنٌ</span> <i>It</i> (an affair,
or event,) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, hard, difficult,</i> or
<i>severe.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَانَتْ لَيْلَتُنَا</span> <i>Our night was,</i>
or <i>became, very cloudy and hot.</i> (Th, M, TA.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَانَ</span> in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رين</span>.

